<title>GREECE: GREECE APPROVES 10.25 BLN DRS FOR PUBLIC WORKS.</title>
<headline>GREECE APPROVES 10.25 BLN DRS FOR PUBLIC WORKS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's Public Works and Environment Minister Costas Laliotis approved credits of 10.25 billion drachmas for public works and water projects, the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>The money will go towards financing projects in central Greece and the city of Salonica.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
